      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "tool_uses": [],
      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Hub keeps the Anthropic API key out of its own process environment by:\n\n1. **Never holding the key in the Hub process** \u2014 The Hub\u0027s process environment is never mutated with the credential.\n\n2. **Using a local secrets loader** \u2014 A secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup.\n\n3. **Injecting only into child processes** \u2014 The key is injected directly into the environment of the spawned Ingest agent (or Query agent) child process, immediately before that process starts.\n\nThis design ensures that a compromised or misbehaving Hub process cannot leak the credential by inspecting its own environment variables, since the key exists only in the short-lived child process that actually needs it to call the Anthropic API.",
      "input_tokens": 2518,
